</title><link><![CDATA[https://www.washingtontimes.com/news/2026/oct/4/pete-hegseth-teases-removal-us-troops-europe-bolster-military/]]></link><description>Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth on Saturday indicated that the U.S. could shift military resources from Europe to Central and South America to bolster the Pentagon's efforts to combat drug trafficking in the hemisphere.
